<title>USA: United Payors Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>United Payors Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKVILLE, Md. 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended March 31,</p>
<p>						   1997		1996</p>
<p> Revenue			     $  13,597,788   $   7,491,624</p>
<p> Net income				3,150,399	 2,449,612</p>
<p> Net income per share			 0.27		0.28</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>  outstanding			   11,605,000	 8,800,000</p>
<p>NOTE: Company said it completed its initial public offering in July 1996.</p>
<p>Full name is United Payors &amp; United Providers Inc.</p>
